{"id": 1007981, "slug": "five-nights-at-stickman", "name": "Five Nights At Stickman", "name_original": "Five Nights At Stickman", "description": "<p>Welcome to Stickman’s Bistro — where the fries are cold and the animatronics are colder.</p><p><strong>Five Nights at Stickman</strong> is a 2D indie horror game inspired by the original FNAF formula. As the new night guard at a suspiciously understaffed stick-figure-themed restaurant, your job is simple: make it through the night without getting… visited.</p><p>Check the security cameras. Shut the doors. Conserve power. And whatever you do — don’t let them in.</p><h3>🔦 Features:</h3><ul><li><p>🕔 <strong>Classic FNAF-style gameplay</strong> – Survive 5 increasingly difficult nights.</p></li><li><p>🎮 <strong>Custom Night mode</strong> – Set your own challenge and test your nerves </p></li><li><p>📹 <strong>Point-and-click survival</strong> – Monitor the building, manage your power, and stay alert</p></li><li><p>👻 <strong>Retro 2D stickman horror vibe</strong> – Simple visuals, big scares</p></li></ul><p>Can you keep your cool? Or will Stickman claim another victim?</p><p>This game was made with Gdevelop 5!</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-08-01", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-08-04T08:58:12", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/564/56439ffb0388cb4aa8eab6552d5b1912.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/b88/b886d87d1e2ee171cf7fffa37c72a654.jpg", "website": "https://www.youtube.com/@Infamousce", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 0, "added_by_status": null, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 8, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "twitch_count": 0, "youtube_count": 0, "reviews_text_count": 0, "ratings_count": 0, "suggestio